WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.053
An algebraic expression uses symbols and numbers. Substitute a value for the letter

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:06.173
to evaluate it.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:14.271
Evaluate 4x plus 3 when x equals 12. The answer is 51. Substitute x equals 12: 4

00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:16.825
times 12 plus 3 equals 51.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.723
A fee on a football field is 2 cedis plus 2 cedis per item. For 7 items, what is the

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.529
total? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:33.359
A fee on a football field is 2 cedis plus 2 cedis per item. For 7 items, what is the

00:00:33.359 --> 00:00:38.953
total? The answer is 16. Substitute x equals 7: 2 times 7 plus 2 equals 16.
